{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191", "ja": "プロローグ", "zh": "序幕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9d911ef0320227387317b41bbfa1404ced563a6c7edcc32599019c84491dab6", "ja": "イベントコミュのプロローグです", "zh": "这是活动剧情的序幕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "59458d35760ffc1fee62d815b24e9b829a864abf6126d10f6052f0539b8c7d97", "ja": "おはようございます。\nなんだか、今日はムワッとしますね……。", "zh": "早安。\n总觉得今天很闷热呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "51589a1e7d8fe03712b3c13bae2cf59cddbc385f579ee0329bcf13e55d8b1c3f", "ja": "うう、そうなんです。\nちょっと、エアコンの調子が悪いみたいで……。", "zh": "呜呜，对啊。\n空调好像有点怪怪的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "290a9a530bbeb61baefa8c88e100d49664ad4b4935b7f8170147b65b6dcc276a", "ja": "これから暑くなる時期なのに、困りましたね。\n社長に相談してきましょうか。", "zh": "这样可真伤脑筋，天气都要开始变热了啊。\n我去找社长商量一下好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "9209d4db3a72b52286988d7a0c9f6da2bffcdc66034d9d204a52ddc2082e50fe", "ja": "いいんですか？", "zh": "可以麻烦你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bb2d6c27afedc3cc74f43acdbbc98327051dbe4f74354896729974a6f977abe8", "ja": "ええ、ちょうど届けたい書類があったので。\nそれじゃ、いってきます。", "zh": "嗯，我刚好也有文件要给社长。\n那我走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "0e3008bb469ac7d754babb2a8035d642aa3448f3be81f1f9f5c9a950e61ce651", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nありがとうございます！　いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你！请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "3686581d654fee64c2e923a59ae0f4dc72144708783b5bd81615358f98a2f56b", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n何か急用ですか？", "zh": "工作辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n你有什么急事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2437144fac1cadadd8355726e252adc89d9dc60ebf47afc94d415451a079476c", "ja": "劇場のエアコンが調子悪くて……。\n社長、業者さんに修理をお願いしてもいいですか？", "zh": "剧场里的空调怪怪的……\n社长，我可以去请人来修吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "0b9efe6f9f7c1dc80a7915a08894510f1fc4697880b2465eb2b22d9673186d53", "ja": "なるほど、状況はわかった。\nだが、業者さんに連絡する必要はないよ。", "zh": "原来如此，状况我都明白了。\n但是没必要去请人来修。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "d64ee93130b8ecb39fbb25d650692f1b086fad18448a38c245a62561c0d14fa1", "ja": "そういう時は、私の出番だ！", "zh": "这种时候，就轮到我出马了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "afcd1b556d7ac281b362d51ba2c9c75961c682af8432a301ddbacf11cec67e9a", "ja": "社長、またそんな事を……。そう言って、\n事務所のエアコンも直らなかったじゃないですか。", "zh": "社长，你又说这种话……你之前也这么说，\n后来还不是没修好事务所的空调。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "48ac9587140bf133b0a8cccccd0678c24025284c68a0b020e8d3eee5434fb48e", "ja": "いやいや、画期的な方法を編み出したのだよ。\n今度こそ大丈夫だ！", "zh": "不不，我有研究出崭新的方法。\n这次一定没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d303eb3ca1120d8a46c243a6db452c818cee8987edb9cb97fc5dabe0886d2267", "ja": "社長にそんな特技が……！\nそれじゃあすみませんが、修理お願いします！", "zh": "想不到社长身怀绝技……！\n那么不好意思，就麻烦社长修理了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "d340d3739ac43c371183b99e9597ecf39f9ceda58502b4eee502ad92d36e84f9", "ja": "ふふふ、時代はDIYだよ、君！\n任せてくれたまえ！", "zh": "哼哼哼，我跟你说，这个时代就是要DIY！\n尽管包在我身上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "111ff3e44ba9d628e6530f2b4bda1727fefa40ba6c9b1eb03ac55927c3af6a11", "ja": "ところで、話は変わるが……ちょうど良かった。\n君に、大事な話があったのだよ。", "zh": "对了，换个话题……你来得正好。\n我有件重要的事要对你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "520acb5d041dbf92242fcb31aa0492124e3359c7040e5bc111c6ff24cadfe1ef", "ja": "大事な話？\nもしかして……！", "zh": "重要的事？\n难道是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "82e3aa3e9c270679066dfcf18696a30cf7f878b455fc405e6f3490f6bb2fbbac", "ja": "ああ、君に任せたいユニットがあってね。\nその名も、『エターナルハーモニー』だ！", "zh": "没错，我有个团体想要交给你培育。\n团名叫做『Eternal Harmony』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "77e8f1779092b36f5b75e3557fd705689e0d13060c4cbf1f569ce98b298f96ce", "ja": "ステキなユニット名ですよね。社長がオペラを\n見ていて、ピンときたユニット名らしいですよ！", "zh": "这团体名称很棒对不对？\n好像是社长在看歌剧时，突然想到的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "bc337c844e3bccbbbcb9dcfa4a69c227d87d8b4df0c3e40414db41ee89105d3a", "ja": "メンバーは、如月千早君、徳川まつり君、\nエミリー君、豊川風花君、ジュリア君の5人だ！", "zh": "团员是如月千早、德川茉莉、\n艾蜜莉、丰川风花、茱莉亚这五个人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "42c56e82945d6badfc57df379f367e99afb2971c944ee4b566a756c9c3ed3c0b", "ja": "どうだね、引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "如何？你愿意接下这份工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_1021", "source_sha256": "9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3", "ja": "もちろんです！", "zh": "当然愿意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6fcb58e1997097592e29fd10d106b9a67548ca4b0f4968e5ddba27f899420319", "ja": "もちろんです。\nぜひ、プロデュースさせてください！", "zh": "我当然愿意。\n请务必让我来培育她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "5c6db8694b8f9b4749a9f9f5e216a5f17ce06d63fc8fd6c9eb3c6d940a8b3bd4", "ja": "うむ！　実に頼もしい返事だ！", "zh": "嗯！真是可靠的回答！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "e9f0560f940c0fd125cf02618f985b424edc1b88d9613558a644ff3dd8e357ad", "ja": "これからも、アイドル達と二人三脚……\nいや、五十三人五十四脚……。", "zh": "今后你也要跟偶像用两人三脚的方式……\n不，是五十三人五十四脚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "d1871251b01234c03de57638502c0ccf3d66e4ba377495b4bf8be522cc12d941", "ja": "あっ、それとも、私と音無君と青羽君も入れて\n五十六人五十七脚かな？　いやいや、早坂君も……。", "zh": "啊，还是要把我跟音无和青羽也算进去，\n这样就是五十六人五十七脚吗？不对不对，还有早坂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2004_president", "source_sha256": "91f501efff73f9ed19fa2b5fc8ac32f9678427f5858206a381fccbb28f046a04", "ja": "……とにかく、\nそんな感じで劇場の発展につとめてもらいたい！", "zh": "……总而言之，\n你要以这种感觉让剧场持续发展下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2006_101kot", "source_sha256": "07e22aae1c3ab53a525bf455e2392a99de7b2cdc549b2b9a9cd430df9e27a016", "ja": "頑張ってくださいね、{$P$}さん！\n事務所も忙しくなりそうですよ～。ふふっ。", "zh": "加油喔，{$P$}先生！\n看来事务所也要忙起来了～呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2007_p", "source_sha256": "b4c9524a1d262fd3d108ee73f9e4064c9e4eee39cace01683582b96f69693609", "ja": "ありがとうございます、音無さん。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "谢谢你的鼓励，音无小姐。\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_intro_2008_p", "source_sha256": "628f38e7b64ee8353d3f505800d1c3d7882b64dba234227fd53ea34f39b74626", "ja": "（エターナルハーモニーか……。その名の通り、\n永遠に語り継がれるような公演にしたいな！）", "zh": "（『Eternal Harmony』吗……真希望能如同团名，\n举办一场永远流传于后世的公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
